              "text": "a falta — \"the absence (from class); the lack; the foul\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Tive uma falta porque cheguei atrasado. I was marked absent because I arrived late."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Fazer falta — to be missed or needed; sem falta — without fail. In football, a foul."
            }
          ]
        },
