          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "falta is built on faltar \"to be missing\", usually traced to Vulgar Latin fallita, from Latin fallere \"to deceive, to disappoint\" (Lewis & Short)."
            }
          ]
        },
